  "description": "Commuters have been flocking to the Dew-E DL for its stylish design and because it’s a blast to ride. An aluminum frame features a Kona Rove Verso Full Carbon Flat Mount Disc fork. A 10-speed drivetrain works in perfect harmony with the low-profile Shimano motor and integrated battery. Sturdy aluminum fenders and lights keep you dry and visible throughout your ride. Powerful hydraulic disc brakes and 160mm rotors stop on a dime, even in wet conditions and puncture-resistant 650x47c tires keep the road rolling by smoothly whether you’re cruising on pavement, or a dirt path. This is the electric commuter you’ve been searching for!",
